{
  "title": "Warm Spicy Ethiopian Lentil Stew",
  "description": "A spicy and aerated Ethiopian dish featuring lentils, this stew is kid-friendly and Buddhist-temple-friendly, made with bicarbonate of soda for a unique twist, this recipe is a hearty and comforting meal for any occasion",
